<h3 data-i18n="missions">Missions sy asa</h3>
<p data-i18n="missionsText">Mitadiava asa, tanteraho ny iraka ary alefaso hohamarinina ny vokatra.</p>
<button onclick="access('login')" data-i18n="seeMissions">Hijery missions</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="symbol">🎮</div>
<h3 data-i18n="games">Lalao sy fanamby</h3>
<p data-i18n="gamesText">Quiz, Puzzle, Memory ary lalao hafa misy valisoa rehefa voamarina.</p>
<button onclick="access('login')" data-i18n="seeGames">Hijery lalao</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="symbol">👥</div>
<h3 data-i18n="referral">Parrainage</h3>
<p data-i18n="referralText">Mahazo bonus 1 000 Ar rehefa voamarina ny fepetra momba ny olona nasainao.</p>
<button onclick="access('login')" data-i18n="seeMore">Hijery</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="symbol">💳</div>
<h3 data-i18n="withdraw">Fakana vola</h3>
<p data-i18n="withdrawText">Airtel Money sy MVola. Fisintonana manomboka amin'ny 8 000 Ar.</p>
<button onclick="access('login')" data-i18n="withdrawInfo">Hijery ny fepetra</button>
</div>
</div>

<h2 data-i18n="moneyRules">💰 Fitsipika momba ny vola</h2>
<div class="info">
<div data-i18n="currency">• Vola ampiasaina: Ariary (Ar)</div>
<div data-i18n="minimum">• Retrait minimum: 8 000 Ar</div>
<div data-i18n="fee">• Saram-pisintonana: 500 Ar</div>
<div data-i18n="bonus">• Bonus parrainage: 1 000 Ar</div>
<div data-i18n="commission">• Komisiona amin'ny sehatra: 10%</div>
</div>

<h2 data-i18n="securityTitle">🔐 Fiarovana sy fahatokisana</h2>
<div class="info" data-i18n="securityText">
Ny asa sy ny valisoa dia tsy maintsy hamarinina. Ny solde sy ny fangatahana retrait dia hotantanan'ny rafitra azo antoka rehefa vita ny fametrahana ny serveur.
</div>

<h2 data-i18n="adsTitle">📢 Tolotra dokambarotra</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3 data-i18n="sevenDays">7 andro</h3>
<strong>5 000 Ar</strong>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3 data-i18n="thirtyDays">30 andro</h3>
<strong>15 000 Ar</strong>
</div>
</div>
</main>

<footer>
MADAGASCAR EARN © 2026<br>
